ative agents that can access work data.\nWhich type of license should you recommend for the users?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"a Microsoft 365 Copilot add-on license"},{"id":"b","label":"Microsoft Copilot Studio user license"},{"id":"c","label":"a Copilot Chat pay-as-you-go plan"}],"correctOptionIds":["a"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nA. a Microsoft 365 Copilot add-on license"},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-026-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 26","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 26 · video frame around 00:41:00","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=2460s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q027","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 27","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"For each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No."}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"true_false","statements":[{"id":"s1","label":"Microsoft Foundry helps organizations securely build and manage generative AI solutions in a governed environment."},{"id":"s2","label":"Microsoft Foundry provides built-in scalability to enable organizations to expand AI workloads as usage increases."},{"id":"s3","label":"Microsoft Foundry can be used for image recognition and computer vision tasks."}],"correctValues":{"s1":true,"s2":true,"s3":true}},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nStatement 1: Yes\nStatement 2: Yes\nStatement 3: Yes"},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-027-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 27","caption":"Source answer frame from the 