pany plans to build a generative AI solution based on internal data.\nYou recommend using Microsoft Foundry as a starting point to develop and manage the solution. What is a key benefit of\nusing Microsoft Foundry for this project?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Provides a scalable platform for developing and deploying generative AI solutions."},{"id":"b","label":"Removes the need to select or configure the underlying AI model."},{"id":"c","label":"Enables business users to build generative AI solutions."},{"id":"d","label":"Offers a low-code platform for developing generative AI solutions."}],"correctOptionIds":["a"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nA. Provides a scalable platform for developing and deploying generative AI solutions."},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-029-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 29","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 29 · video frame around 00:46:10","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=2770s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q030","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 30","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Select the answer that correctly completes the sentence.\nThe primary goal of generative AI is [blank]."}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"matching","prompts":[{"id":"p1","label":"The primary goal of generative AI is","allowedChoiceIds":["c1","c2","c3"]}],"choices":[{"id":"c1","label":"to analyze trends and classify data sources."},{"id":"c2","label":"to create new content, such as text, images, or code."},{"id":"c3","label":"to make predictions based on historical data."}],"allowReuse":false,"correctPairs":{"p1":"c2"}},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nThe primary goal of generative AI is: to create new content, such as text, images, or code."},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-030-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 30","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 30 · video frame around 00:47:40","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=2860s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q031","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 31","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Your company uses generative AI to assist with content creation and customer interactions.\nYou need to evaluate whether Azure Machine Learning can add value to the current customer management. For which use\ncase should you use Machine Learning?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"predicting customer retention"},{"id":"b","label":"creating product descriptions from images"},{"id":"c","label":"generating marketing campaigns"},{"id":"d","label":"summarizing customer service transcripts"}],"correctOptionIds":["a"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nA. predicting customer retention"},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-031-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 31","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 31 · video frame around 00:49:10","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=2950s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q032","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 32","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"For each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No."}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"true_false","statements":[{"id":"s1","label":"Lack of trust in the security and accuracy of AI solutions is a common barrier to AI adoption."},{"id":"s2","label":"AI adoption efforts often fail when organizations overlook the importance of high-quality data."},{"id":"s3","label":"AI adoption is most successful when implemented with business and compliance stakeholders."}],"correctValues":{"s1":true,"s2":true,"s3":true}},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nStatement 1: Yes\nStatement 2: Yes\nStatement 3: Yes"},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-032-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 32","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 32 · video frame around 00:51:00","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=3060s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q033","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 33","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Your company plans to use an AI-powered solution to analyze customer feedback for insights related to future product\ndesigns.\nYou need to mitigate the privacy risks associated with the solution.\nWhat is the best approach to achieve the goal?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Delete all the feedback data immediately after analysis."},{"id":"b","label":"Ensure that feedback is attributable to the customer so that it can be deleted upon request."},{"id":"c","label":"Limit privacy reviews to the final stage of the AI project lifecycle."},{"id":"d","label":"Anonymize the source data to remove customer Personally Identifiable Information (PII) from the feedback."}],"correctOptionIds":["d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nD. Anonymize the source data to remove customer Personally Identifiable Information (PII) from the feedback."},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-033-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 33","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 33 · video frame around 00:52:50","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=3170s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q034","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 34","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Your company creates a custom Azure Machine Learning model that uses a generative AI assistant.\nThe mode initially delivers strong results. However, six months later, the model predictions become noticeably less\naccurate.\nWhat is a possible cause of the issue?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"The model requires additional compute resources."},{"id":"b","label":"The input data changed over time."},{"id":"c","label":"The model was trained incorrectly."}],"correctOptionIds":["b"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nB. The input data changed over time."},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-034-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 34","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 34 · video frame around 00:54:40","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=3280s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q035","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 35","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Select the answer that correctly completes the sentence.\nYou use [blank] to train a model that will forecast product demand based on historical sales data."}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"matching","prompts":[{"id":"p1","label":"You use","allowedChoiceIds":["c1","c2","c3","c4"]}],"choices":[{"id":"c1","label":"Azure Machine Learning"},{"id":"c2","label":"Azure AI Search"},{"id":"c3","label":"Azure OpenAI"},{"id":"c4","label":"Microsoft Foundry"}],"allowReuse":false,"correctPairs":{"p1":"c1"}},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nYou use: Azure Machine Learning"},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-035-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 35","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 35 · video frame around 00:56:20","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=3380s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q036","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 36","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Your company uses a non-reasoning generative AI model to create textual content.\nYou discover that the model's responses are inconsistent and do NOT meet expectations. You need to improve the prompts.\nWhat should you do?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Provide the prompts with extensive examples of the expected output."},{"id":"b","label":"Add the context, sources, and expectations to the prompts."},{"id":"c","label":"Use technical terms in the prompts to enhance AI comprehension."},{"id":"d","label":"Add only a single concise requirement to the prompts."}],"correctOptionIds":["b"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nB. Add the context, sources, and expectations to the prompts."},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-036-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 36","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 36 · video frame around 00:57:40","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=3460s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q037","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 37","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"You have a historical dataset that contains 1,000 records.\nYou need an AI solution that can analyze the data to identify patterns and predict future outcomes. What should you include\nin the solution?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Microsoft Foundry"},{"id":"b","label":"Azure Document Intelligence in Foundry Tools"},{"id":"c","label":"Azure Machine Learning"},{"id":"d","label":"Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools"}],"correctOptionIds":["c"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nC. Azure Machine Learning"},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-037-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 37","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 37 · video frame around 00:59:30","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=3570s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q038","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 38","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"For each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No."}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"true_false","statements":[{"id":"s1","label":"Microsoft Copilot provides a single AI app that has identical features and experiences across all Microsoft products."},{"id":"s2","label":"Microsoft 365 Copilot delivers AI capabilities for business users that use Microsoft 365 apps."},{"id":"s3","label":"Microsoft Security Copilot helps companies understand risks and the organizational security posture."}],"correctValues":{"s1":false,"s2":true,"s3":true}},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nStatement 1: No\nStatement 2: Yes\nStatement 3: Yes"},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-038-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 38","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 38 · video frame around 01:01:20","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=3680s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q039","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 39","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Your company plans to adopt AI across multiple business units.\nYou need to ensure that all AI projects align with the company's business strategy and are implemented responsibly.\nWhat is the best approach to achieve the goal?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Allow each department to deploy its own AI tools and workflows."},{"id":"b","label":"Delegate AI decision-making to the company's IT department."},{"id":"c","label":"Outsource AI development to an external vendor."},{"id":"d","label":"Establish an AI council to provide guidance, oversight, and coordination."}],"correctOptionIds":["d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nD. Establish an AI council to provide guidance, oversight, and coordination."},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-039-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 39","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 39 · video frame around 01:03:20","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=3800s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q040","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 40","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Your company stores hundreds of internal business reports.\nYou need to recommend a generative AI solution that uses an agent to answer questions based on the content in the\nreports.\nWhat should you include in the recommendation?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"natural language processing"},{"id":"b","label":"Azure Machine Learning"},{"id":"c","label":"Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)"},{"id":"d","label":"Generative Adversarial Network (GAN)"}],"correctOptionIds":["c"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nC. Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)"},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-040-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 40","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 40 · video frame around 01:05:00","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=3900s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q041","topicId":"practi