 adopt Microsoft 365 Copilot and wants to follow Microsoft responsible AI principles. As a\nbusiness leader, you propose establishing an AI governance council to ensure alignment with the responsible AI principles.\nWhat is the primary purpose of the council?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"to monitor user behavior and enforce compliance with internal IT policies"},{"id":"b","label":"to train employees on how to use Copilot features effectively"},{"id":"c","label":"to oversee implementation, manage technical performance, and ensure successful AI deployment"},{"id":"d","label":"to guide strategy, provide oversight, and ensure cross-functional alignment for responsible AI adoption"}],"correctOptionIds":["d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nD. to guide strategy, provide oversight, and ensure cross-functional alignment for responsible AI adoption"},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-068-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 68","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 68 · video frame around 01:58:00","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=7080s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q069","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 69","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"For each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No."}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"true_false","statements":[{"id":"s1","label":"Users that want to reason over work data by using a natural language prompt in Microsoft 365 Copilot must have a Copilot add-on license."},{"id":"s2","label":"Microsoft 365 Copilot is included in Microsoft 365 E3 and Microsoft 365 E5 licenses."},{"id":"s3","label":"Some Microsoft 365 Copilot services are available through a pay-as-you-go plan."}],"correctValues":{"s1":true,"s2":false,"s3":true}},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nStatement 1: Yes\nStatement 2: No\nStatement 3: Yes"},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-069-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 69","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 69 · video frame around 01:59:40","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=7180s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q070","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 70","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Your company receives thousands of scanned invoices each month.\nYou need to recommend an AI solution that can automatically extract key details, such as invoice numbers, vendor names, and\ntotal amounts.\nWhat is the best solution to recommend?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Azure Document Intelligence in Foundry Tools"},{"id":"b","label":"Azure Vision in Foundry Tools"},{"id":"c","label":"Azure AI Search"},{"id":"d","label":"Azure Machine Learning"}],"correctOptionIds":["a"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nA. Azure Document Intelligence in Foundry Tools"},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-070-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 70","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 70 · video frame around 02:01:30","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=7290s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q071","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 71","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Match the business scenario to the appropriate AI solution design approach.\nTo answer, drag the AI solution from the column on the left to its business scenario on the right. Each solution may be used\nonce, more than once, or not at all."}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"matching","prompts":[{"id":"p1","label":"The marketing department at your company wants AI to summarize emails and create presentations.","allowedChoiceIds":["c1","c2","c3","c4"]},{"id":"p2","label":"The HR department at your company wants a conversational agent for policy questions and leave requests.","allowedChoiceIds":["c1","c2","c3","c4"]},{"id":"p3","label":"The manufacturing department at your company wants AI to predict maintenance schedules.","allowedChoiceIds":["c1","c2","c3","c4"]},{"id":"p4","label":"The finance department at your company wants AI-powered access to enterprise resource planning (ERP) data by using familiar productivity tools.","allowedChoiceIds":["c1","c2","c3","c4"]}],"choices":[{"id":"c1","label":"Build with Azure Machine Learning"},{"id":"c2","label":"Build with Microsoft Copilot Studio"},{"id":"c3","label":"Extend with Microsoft 365 Copilot connectors"},{"id":"c4","label":"Use Microsoft 365 Copilot"}],"allowReuse":false,"correctPairs":{"p1":"c4","p2":"c2","p3":"c1","p4":"c3"}},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nThe marketing department at your company wants AI to summarize emails and create presentations.: Use Microsoft 365 Copilot\nThe HR department at your company wants a conversational agent for policy questions and leave requests.: Build with Microsoft Copilot Studio\nThe manufacturing department at your company wants AI to predict maintenance schedules.: Build with Azure Machine Learning\nThe finance department at your company wants AI-powered access to enterprise resource planning (ERP) data by using familiar productivity tools.: Extend with Microsoft 365 Copilot connectors"},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-071-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 71","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 71 · video frame around 02:03:00","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=7380s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q072","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 72","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"For each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No."}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"true_false","statements":[{"id":"s1","label":"Prompt engineering involves specifying guidelines that help a generative AI model generate useful and accurate responses."},{"id":"s2","label":"The instruction is the part of the prompt that includes examples to show the AI what its response should look like."},{"id":"s3","label":"The context is the part of the prompt that helps a generative AI model understand which information to use when generating a response."}],"correctValues":{"s1":true,"s2":false,"s3":true}},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nStatement 1: Yes\nStatement 2: No\nStatement 3: Yes"},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-072-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 72","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 72 · video frame around 02:05:40","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=7540s"},"r