rints, such as the location of electrical, heating, and plumbing systems\nWhat should you recommend?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"a multi-modal solution"},{"id":"b","label":"an optical character recognition (OCR) solution"},{"id":"c","label":"a text completion solution"},{"id":"d","label":"a document summarization solution"}],"correctOptionIds":["a"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nA. a multi-modal solution"},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-089-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 89","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 89 · video frame around 02:34:00","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=9240s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q090","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 90","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Your company discovers that several employees use personal ChatGPT accounts to assist with work tasks. You are\nconcerned about proprietary data being shared externally.\nYou need to evaluate the business value of rolling out Microsoft 365 Copilot.\nWhich capability is a key benefit of using Copilot instead of a personal ChatGPT account?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"single_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"analyzing and producing reports based on complex data"},{"id":"b","label":"generating ideas and solving issues"},{"id":"c","label":"drafting documents, emails, presentations, and marketing materials"},{"id":"d","label":"accessing internal data in accordance with existing Microsoft 365 policies"}],"correctOptionIds":["d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nD. accessing i