o support business process automation and employee\nself-service.\nWhich two capabilities are directly supported in Copilot Studio?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"multiple_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"drafting and summarizing files in Microsoft Word and PowerPoint"},{"id":"b","label":"customizing agent behavior and responses"},{"id":"c","label":"using agents to identify and respond to security incidents"},{"id":"d","label":"building agents that connect to business data and automate user interactions"},{"id":"e","label":"configuring document security"}],"correctOptionIds":["b","d"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nB. customizing agent behavior and responses\nD. building agents that connect to business data and automate user interactions"},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-092-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 92","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 92 · video frame around 02:41:10","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=9670s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q093","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 93","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"For each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No."}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"true_false","statements":[{"id":"s1","label":"Microsoft 365 Copilot connectors enable you to index data from multiple sources to make the data available in Copilot."},{"id":"s2","label":"You can build a custom Microsoft 365 Copilot connector when the available connectors do NOT meet your data integration requirements."},{"id":"s3","label":"To use Microsoft 365 Copilot connectors, you need a Microsoft Copilot Studio license."}],"correctValues":{"s1":true,"s2":true,"s3":false}},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nStatement 1: Yes\nStatement 2: Yes\nStatement 3: No"},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-093-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 93","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 93 · video frame around 02:42:40","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=9760s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q094","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 94","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Select the answer that correctly completes the sentence.\nUsing high-quality grounding data in a generative AI solution [blank]."}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"matching","prompts":[{"id":"p1","label":"Using high-quality grounding data","allowedChoiceIds":["c1","c2","c3","c4"]}],"choices":[{"id":"c1","label":"ensures that all responses are factually accurate."},{"id":"c2","label":"increases performance of an AI model."},{"id":"c3","label":"improves the accuracy and reliability of the predictions and outputs of AI."},{"id":"c4","label":"increases the amount of storage required to host an AI model."}],"allowReuse":false,"correctPairs":{"p1":"c3"}},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nUsing high-quality grounding data: improves the accuracy and reliability of the predictions and outputs of AI."},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-094-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 94","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"