the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 97 · video frame around 02:49:20","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=10160s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q098","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 98","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Your company has an AI solution that uses a prebuilt Azure OpenAI model to generate content.\nYou need to reduce the cost of solution while minimizing the impact on the quality of the generated output. Which two actions\nshould you perform?"}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"multiple_choice","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Switch to an alternate model."},{"id":"b","label":"Apply content moderation."},{"id":"c","label":"Optimize the prompts."},{"id":"d","label":"Decrease the number of hosting hours for the model."},{"id":"e","label":"Fine-tune the existing model."}],"correctOptionIds":["a","c"]},"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Correct answer(s) from the source:\nA. Switch to an alternate model.\nC. Optimize the prompts."},{"type":"image","src":"/content/ab-731/q-098-answer.jpg","alt":"AB-731 source answer frame for question 98","caption":"Source answer frame from the supplied YouTube video."}],"optionExplanations":[],"source":{"name":"AB-731: AI Transformation Leader - All 100 Exam Prep Practice Questions with Answers (YouTube video)","locator":"Question 98 · video frame around 02:50:50","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4m8LS2Jzqs&t=10250s"},"review":{"status":"ready","notes":[]}},{"id":"ab731-q099","topicId":"practice-images","title":"Question 99","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"For each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No."}],"contextId":null,"difficulty":"unspecified","interaction":{"type":"true_false","statements":[{"id":"s1","